Troubleshooting

Missing dependencies

pip install -r requirements.txt

⸻

Docker not installed

docker --version

⸻

FPGA runtime issues

Verify:

* Vitis AI runtime installation
* FPGA board compatibility
* DPU overlay configuration

⸻

Slow CPU inference

CPU execution is intended for validation only. Real-time performance is achieved through FPGA DPU acceleration.

